# U25: the mastery popup and ModifyNodePopup at 1280x800 (allflame_compare zoomed in): click the unallocated Life
# Mastery (OpenMasteryPopup: five effects, the sixth is taken by another Life Mastery), hover an effect
# (AddValueTooltip writes it into the node and shows the node tooltip stand-in), Cancel (the node's stats restored),
# open it again and pick the second effect (SaveMasteryPopup: allocates along the path, AddUndoState); then
# right-click the allocated Pain Attunement keystone (ModifyNodePopup: the tattoo groups for a keystone, the labels
# of the default group, the tattoo count), drop the modifier list, pick an entry (constructUI resizes the popup), Add
# (RETURN: hashOverrides, ReplaceNode); then the build XML.
